# Everything that would bloat the build context or leak local state into an
# image. The Dockerfile copies workspaces explicitly, so this is belt and braces.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.claude

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

.local-mongo-data
**/screenshots
playwright-report
test-results

docs
infra
runners
scripts
